    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "Generate 10 Amazon bestseller category URLs for floor lamps, lighting, and all home decor related products.\n\nThe ONLY valid URL format is:\nhttps://www.amazon.com/Best-Sellers-CATEGORY-NAME/zgbs/DEPARTMENT/\n\nRules:\n\nDEPARTMENT must be one of: home-garden, kitchen, tools, lawn-garden, baby-products, pet-supplies\nCATEGORY-NAME must match real Amazon category naming style (Title-Case-With-Hyphens)\nNever use /gp/bestsellers/ format — it does not work\nNever add query parameters or ref tags\nEach URL must be different\nBe specific with subcategories (not just \"home-garden\" alone)\nFocus only on lighting, floor lamps, table lamps, lampshades, rugs, candles, furniture, and home decor items\n\nReal examples to learn the pattern from:\nhttps://www.amazon.com/Best-Sellers-Home-Kitchen-Bedding/zgbs/home-garden/\n\nhttps://www.amazon.com/Best-Sellers-Home-Kitchen-Furniture/zgbs/home-garden/\n\nhttps://www.amazon.com/Best-Sellers-Home-Kitchen-Lighting/zgbs/home-garden/\n\nhttps://www.amazon.com/Best-Sellers-Home-Kitchen-Rugs/zgbs/home-garden/\n\nhttps://www.amazon.com/Best-Sellers-Home-Kitchen-Candles/zgbs/home-garden/\n\nIMPORTANT: Omit the numeric ID at the end — just end with the department.\nExample: https://www.amazon.com/Best-Sellers-Home-Kitchen-Curtains/zgbs/home-garden/\n\nReturn ONLY a JSON array of 10 URLs. No explanation. No markdown. No backticks.",
        "options": {}
